  <mainDescription>&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot; data-lfile-container=&quot;0ed17888-7550-4ff3-ba73-22e13a93b12a&quot;>&#xD;
    Módulo del frontend (&lt;code spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; autocapitalize=&quot;off&quot; autocorrect=&quot;off&quot;>api.js&lt;/code>) que concentra todas&#xD;
